ncies may exist due to sampling, but they do not undermine overall realism.\n- Overall, physical/common-sense consistency is solid, corresponding to a score around 4.\n\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 3\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 4\n"
